Brainstorm commit 952475b (13 October 2026, brainstorm-tools/brainstorm3 #942: "Java: Replace
removed sun.misc Base64 classes with java.util.Base64"), the same changes on the pinned
Brainstorm 3.250107 (commit 69bbf53), whose bst_report.m differs around them. Without it,
Brainstorm cannot read GIfTI files (CAT12's surfaces) with Java 9 or later. Applied by
tools/fetch_toolboxes.sh:  patch -d <Toolboxes>/brainstorm3 -p1 --binary < this file
(CRLF line endings, as in Brainstorm's repository: keep them).

